          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaki abwira Balāmu ati “Nuko ngwino nkujyane ahandi, ahari Imana irakunda ko ubamvumirirayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaki ajyana Balāmu mu mpinga ya Pewori, harengeye ubutayu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balāmu abwira Balaki ati “Nyubakishiriza hano ibicaniro birindwi, unyitegurire hano amapfizi arindwi n'amasekurume y'intama arindwi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
